------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY SCOPE  (Honesty #2 No-scope-narrowing)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The web <Accordion> is a PURE presentational PRIMITIVE. Its inputs are plain props (title, children,
defaultOpen, the controlled open + onOpenChange, icon, badge, headerExtra) and it renders a header button
over an animated body. There is NO fetch, NO React-Query cache, NO Promise -> therefore NO loading / error
/ stale / offline branch (there is nothing to fetch, fail, age, or disconnect from; the hosted children
own their own data states). Reproducing those generic states would FABRICATE behaviour the source does not
have, so this surface reproduces only the source's REAL branches — exactly the disposition the sibling
presentational primitives Delta (0081), MetricCard (0095), InlineCallout (0124), ActiveFilterChips (0147),
and StaggerItem (0194) used. The REAL branches, all reproduced + tested:
  • collapsed            : header only (icon? + title + badge? + headerExtra? + chevron at 0°).
  • expanded             : header + body (children) revealed, chevron at 180° (web rotate-180), top border.
  • controlled mode      : open resolved from the prop, ignoring the local flag; taps route out through
                           onOpenChange (web isControlled -> setOpen -> onOpenChange).
  • uncontrolled mode    : open from internalOpen seeded by defaultOpen (web useState(defaultOpen)); taps
                           flip the local flag; defaultOpen is initial-only and never reseeds on re-render.
  • optional regions     : icon / badge / headerExtra rendered iff supplied (web `icon && ...` etc.).
  • reduced motion       : open/close + chevron animate via easeInOut(normal); nil (instant) under reduce.
  • empty-body leaf      : the native never-a-blank-box peer of an expanded section with no children.
Data source  : none (pure presentational; open state is local interaction state, not fetched).
Shared comps : none (the web source uses none).
Charts/maps  : none (the web source uses none) -> Swift Charts / MapKit not required.
i18n keys    : none in source (anonymous; title is a caller prop); only native a11y additions, resolved
               through the P1/S10 facade.
Telemetry    : view.opened emitted once with slug "Accordion" (P1/S11).
a11y         : header is one tap target with explicit label (title) + value (Expanded/Collapsed, the spoken
               peer of aria-expanded) + hint (Expand/Collapse section); chevron hidden from VoiceOver;
               reduce-motion honored; Dynamic Type via tokens; empty leaf is a single combined, labelled
               element.

